        "业务进程经 rt_database_attach() 互信读写 vmem，无 IPC 鉴权"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "辅助进程与外部依赖",
      "items": [
        "Meter 经 mem_nodetable 桥接；data_cache 写 SQLite；netmgrd 管路由",
        "edge_alert / edge_script / anti_reflux 等边缘计算同样挂载 vmem",
        "内核 vmem.ko · 第三方 SQLite/LZ4/Mosquitto · 硬件 RN7302/RS485/GSM"
      ]
    }
